+
+**Claim.** For every finite poset `P`, if `e(P) <= 12`, then its exact
+worst-case comparison sorting depth `F(P) <= 4`; this is sharp because a
+six-element poset with `e(P)=13` has `F(P)=5`. Thus `T(4)=12`.
+
